Constraints
Nmap requires administrative/root privileges for certain scan types (e.g., SYN scan, OS detection).
Scanning networks without permission may be illegal – only scan networks you own or have explicit permission to scan.
Some firewalls may block Nmap scans, resulting in inaccurate results.
